Source: pg-statviz
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/vyruss/pg_statviz

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-statviz
Architecture: all
Provides: postgresql-statviz
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: PostgreSQL statistics snapshots for visualization
 pg_statviz captures PostgreSQL statistics snapshots in a fixed schema for
 time-series analysis and visualization. This package contains only the SQL
 extension and does not include the optional Python command-line client.
